  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only singleprofile model using pca_n2000 encoder, achieving 0.4849 validation accuracy and 0.4639 F1, lower than the multimodal baseline (0.5266 accuracy). The results suggest RNA modality alone may contribute less than multimodal approaches, but the specific role of fusion methods remains uncertain without direct comparison to other fusion strategies."
